Carnivorous pets like cats and dogs want to move towards a
tripe ration.  So keeping it in your inventory means they want
to move towards you.  Dropping it removes their motivation to
move towards you and replaces it with other benefits that are
described in spoilers.  So keep or drop, that's a question of
knowing what each means and it's a judgement call.



